    "description": "Designed by EAG Studios and rebuilt in 2015, this Cow Hollow Contemporary offers large-scale rooms and outdoor living spaces on its deep lot. Maximizing outdoor living, the home features a glass-sided roof terrace and a tiered, landscaped garden with an outdoor kitchen. The main level's great room is anchored by a well-appointed, oversized kitchen with Carrera marble counters, center island, and suite of Miele appliances. The nearby den and breakfast areas open to the outdoors. The living and dining areas boast soaring ceilings, custom drapery, neighborhood outlooks, and wine storage. Upstairs, the primary suite overlooks the garden and enjoys a large walk-in closet and spa-like bath with steam shower, bathtub, and double vanity. A skylit home office, two additional bedrooms, and laundry appliances complete this level. The lower unit offers a bedroom suite with a kitchenette, large bath, and Fleetwood doors that open wide to the garden. Savant home automation, radiant heat, security system, two EV chargers, and solar power ensure effortless living - just moments from the Presidio, Golden Gate Bridge and the bustling Union Street Corridor."
  },
